  "_documented_limits": "8 patterns per dictionary; 256 bytes per pattern; proximity 0-10000 bytes; PCRE syntax minus lookaround; phrases fuzzy-match unless quoted; Count Unique collapses repeated matches to a single count. Engine builder: 4 subexpressions / 4 operators / 16 dictionaries per operator per level; root accepts All, Any, Sum only. Proximity requires BOTH the proximity integer AND proximityEnabledForCustomDictionary = true on custom dictionaries. Engine match counts accept any value under 1000.",
  "engines": [
    {
      "name": "CUI-Detect-All",
      "description": "Full CUI detection surface: banner grammar, category tokens, legacy markings, malformed-marking proximity, and designation blocks.",
      "engineExpression": "((((${CUI-Banner-Structural}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Banner-LDC}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-PortionMark-Structural}.S > 1) OR (${CUI-Code-CTI}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-PRVCY}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-PROPIN}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-SSEL}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-ISVI}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-OPSEC}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-NNPI}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-PCII}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Code-CVI}.S > 0) OR (${Legacy-FOUO}.S > 0) OR (${Legacy-LES}.S > 0) OR (${Legacy-SBU}.S > 0) OR (${Legacy-Distribution-Statements}.S > 0)) OR ((${CUI-Prox-EXPT}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-TAX}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-LEI}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-CRIT}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-NUC}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-INTEL}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-LEGAL}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Prox-PROCURE}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-LDC-Standalone}.S > 0) OR (${CUI-Designation-Indicator}.S > 2) OR (${CUI-Basic-Bare}.S > 2)))) AND NOT (${CUI-Decontrol-Context}.S > 0)",
      "_notes": "Split into two nested Any groups solely because of the 16-dictionary-per-operator ceiling, not for logical reasons - the two groups are ORed and behave as one set. Validate the three-level nesting renders in Engine Builder before relying on it; if the builder rejects the depth, restructure as root Any(OR) over the two groups and move the decontrol exclusion into each group."
    },
    {
      "name": "CUI-Detect-Contextual",
      "description": "Content-based CUI signal: three or more distinct marking-guide phrases together with a Registry category name, minus the decontrol exclusion. Monitor only.",
      "engineExpression": "(((${CUI-Contextual-Phrases}.S > 2) AND (${CUI-Category-Phrases}.S > 0))) AND NOT ((${CUI-Decontrol-Context}.S > 0))",
      "_notes": "Replaces the Fed Policy Pack V1.1 'CUI Engine (Low Confidence)'. It catches documents that discuss controlled categories without carrying a well-formed marking; expect it to be the noisiest CUI engine, which is why only CUI-Monitor-All carries it."
    }
  ],
  "_proximity_semantics": "Proximity measures between a PATTERN and a PHRASE within a custom dictionary. Pattern-to-pattern proximity is not available - any design needing a window must place one term in the pattern slot and the other in a phrase.",
  "_phrase_semantics": "Phrase matching is case-insensitive and ignores punctuation - always, and quotes do not change this (quotes only force exact word order and disable noise-word tolerance). A phrase of SP-EXPT therefore also matches lowercase and hyphen-absent variants. Patterns are case-sensitive by default with (?i)/(?-i) tokens available. Phrases: 3-128 bytes, up to 256 per dictionary.",
  "_title": "Fed Policy Pack: CUI markings (tiers 1-7)"
}